Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.37,0:00:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}饶了我吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.37,0:00:12.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）振作点～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）游马！又是陷阱！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.16,0:00:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（2人）哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.77,0:00:20.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 快点～！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.68,0:00:25.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得救了～。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.66,0:00:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 游马到底为什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.25,0:00:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《抽屉 快斗… {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}… {\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.03,0:00:41.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有 鲨鱼…》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.34,0:00:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.49,0:00:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 前面！！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.89,0:00:58.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦？怎么了？这里是！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.76,0:01:04.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 这就是我们战斗的场地。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.62,0:01:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（权现坂）等你好久了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.13,0:01:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是…。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.82,0:01:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}权现坂！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.41,0:01:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 开始吧。游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.61,0:01:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.29,0:02:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Mr.心园）心园 燃烧！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:03:01.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 最后晋级决赛的最终决定是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马 还是 戈什！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.67,0:03:07.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（Mr.心园）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.37,0:03:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}两人战斗的场地是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.73,0:03:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}危险峡谷！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.66,0:03:12.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.69,0:03:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.47,0:03:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马／戈什）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.91,0:03:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}先攻 我拿下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.13,0:03:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.44,0:03:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤英雄挑战者 双枪！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.89,0:03:42.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦～！ 一上来戈什就
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.59,0:03:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因场地魔法的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.24,0:03:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到200点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这个场地上 怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以攻击表示召唤的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.39,0:03:53.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以及 攻击的时候。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.45,0:03:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}玩家竟然
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.71,0:03:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会受到２００点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.64,0:03:59.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那岂不是攻击越多次
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.58,0:04:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生命值就越少？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.47,0:04:03.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎～！这不妙啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.00,0:04:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为我的生命值只有１００啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.04,0:04:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还喜欢吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.99,0:04:13.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我送的礼物。　戈什君。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:18.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此真像是你会搞的把戏。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.57,0:04:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈什）当年还是小鬼的我和德罗瓦{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.85,0:04:29.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被Ｍｒ．心园你捡了回去。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.59,0:04:32.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后被灌输了决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.24,0:04:34.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一直言听计从地照做。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.67,0:04:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是　那家伙　游马的决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.30,0:04:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}点燃了我早已忘却的决斗之魂！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.13,0:04:46.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才是 我所追求的决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.76,0:04:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双枪的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:51.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将英雄冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.17,0:04:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.74,0:04:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只可以当作2只份的超量素材！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.68,0:04:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 等级4的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:04:59.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双枪2只份 进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.26,0:05:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.43,0:05:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.59,0:05:06.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.35,0:05:09.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}英雄冠军 刚德瓦！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.07,0:05:15.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场地魔法造成的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:17.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他连在意都不在意。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 我盖放2张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.39,0:05:23.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 放马过来！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.57,0:05:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让我看看你的气势！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.86,0:05:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔… 权现那家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.70,0:05:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我 考虑到剩余的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.79,0:05:34.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没法好好攻击了》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.76,0:05:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，你在犹豫什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.20,0:05:39.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的他，充满了气势。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:42.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们也必须全力上才行……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:44.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道啦，那种事！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.82,0:05:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就～吃我一记陷阱吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.66,0:05:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟……糟糕！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.41,0:05:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.11,0:05:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}英雄馈赠……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.80,0:05:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个陷阱是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.61,0:05:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当对方生命值在2000以下时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.45,0:05:59.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那个生命值变为4000……。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.39,0:06:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为……为什么我的生命值！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.19,0:06:08.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，还能抽2张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.42,0:06:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么把游马的生命值变成4000？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.33,0:06:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，想干什么～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.57,0:06:16.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别误会……。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.55,0:06:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我只是想抽卡而已……。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.33,0:06:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且　吃掉虚弱的猎物可不是我的兴趣。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂　你这～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《戈什是甚至不惜让游马恢复生命值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.61,0:06:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把一切都押在了这场决斗上…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.90,0:06:33.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这么回事吗》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.27,0:06:37.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我以里侧守备表示把怪兽盖放！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.09,0:06:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！　光靠防守是赢不了他的！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.61,0:06:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没关系啦。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.63,0:06:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我有　我自己的战术！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.60,0:06:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再盖放１张卡　回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.44,0:06:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈…　你还真是谨慎啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.27,0:06:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！　抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.40,0:06:57.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤　英雄挑战者
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.75,0:06:59.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夜袭的提灯！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.85,0:07:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.63,0:07:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样又能造成　２００点伤害了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.85,0:07:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那又怎样！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.63,0:07:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用夜袭的提灯攻击里侧守备怪兽！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.80,0:07:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.56,0:07:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不进行伤害计算{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.94,0:07:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接破坏里侧守备怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你的场地就空空如也了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.83,0:07:39.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以用刚德瓦直接攻击了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.87,0:07:41.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就知道你会来这招！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.62,0:07:42.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.84,0:07:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}摩古摩尔被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以以表侧守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.89,0:07:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你支付了400点发动的攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:53.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}算是白费了！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.36,0:07:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙！开什么玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.67,0:07:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动刚德瓦的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.71,0:08:02.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用1个叠放单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将特殊召唤的等级4以下的1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.21,0:08:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.19,0:08:18.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要是继续打这种半吊子的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就由我来把你打垮！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 甘迪瓦！ 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.79,0:08:27.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动！ 战斗破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.10,0:08:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将发起战斗的怪兽破坏{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.86,0:08:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并结束这场战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为这样就算守住啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.05,0:08:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 斗士的骄傲！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.94,0:08:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将结束战斗的卡无效并破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.68,0:08:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧～ 甘迪瓦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.54,0:08:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖放一张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.61,0:09:01.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明白了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.33,0:09:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就凭这种半吊子打法是打不倒我这种人的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.19,0:09:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 我 这场决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}绝对不能输啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 这场决斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.53,0:09:14.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你… 赢不了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.60,0:09:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.47,0:09:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在的你 对胜利变得过于谨慎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.51,0:09:20.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}害怕着决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.02,0:09:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎…
