Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.09,0:09:29.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在无意识之中 对决斗的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.38,0:09:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐惧感油然而生了吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.09,0:09:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙… 是说我在害怕吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.18,0:09:37.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.09,0:09:39.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.36,0:09:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我… 召唤我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.30,0:09:58.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再 从手牌发动一发魔杖！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.15,0:10:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡可以让魔法师族怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.68,0:10:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 提升８００点！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:08.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来我我我魔术师的攻击力就超过了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.58,0:10:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧～！ 我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.32,0:10:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击伽恩迪瓦！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.30,0:10:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种气势行得通吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.24,0:10:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱卡 英雄进阶！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当英雄冠军被攻击时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.85,0:10:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级4以下的英雄挑战者的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.05,0:10:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力变为2倍{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.73,0:10:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并变更其攻击对象。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.24,0:10:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是！这场战斗中的怪兽不会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.29,0:10:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果发动！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 一击魔杖的\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.37,0:10:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗结束时通过破坏这张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
