Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.27,0:10:58.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好 我特殊召唤隆隆隆！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.37,0:11:01.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方场上有超量怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
