Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将等级4的我我我魔术师和
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.51,0:11:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}隆隆隆进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.84,0:11:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建超量网络！
