Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.17,0:11:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了！怎么样 戈什！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖两张卡 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.05,0:11:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然用这种无聊的攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.50,0:11:57.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 和你……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.25,0:12:00.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和你 这种无聊的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.47,0:12:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不想打！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.35,0:12:05.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.86,0:12:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌发动装备魔法发动超量宝冠！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.15,0:12:12.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了这张卡的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.43,0:12:15.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其阶级变为等级{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成为2个
