Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.93,0:12:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将等级4的夜袭提灯和
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.18,0:12:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成2个分量的军荼利天女进行叠放。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}构建叠放网络！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.21,0:12:32.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.75,0:12:37.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！英雄冠军 草{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}薙{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.15,0:12:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 放马过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.38,0:12:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想打倒我的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用真正的你{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
