Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.23,0:13:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游、游马 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下车吧 小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.47,0:13:43.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接下来我一个人去。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:43.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.78,0:13:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.81,0:13:47.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和那家伙的决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.22,0:13:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我必须押上我的全部
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.37,0:13:51.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才行{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我明白了！
