Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.12,0:14:01.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为交换 绝对要赢然后回来接我们哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.00,0:14:02.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
