Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:12.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 确实快斗和鲨鱼很强。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.17,0:14:14.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拥有着可怕的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.13,0:14:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算你对那样的他们{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感到了恐惧
