Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.23,0:14:23.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你一直以来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都跨越了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.70,0:14:25.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那样的恐惧才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.95,0:14:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体… 上了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.23,0:14:31.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我啊 到头来 只能进行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.57,0:14:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的决斗啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.23,0:14:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.44,0:14:38.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈什！
