Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.96,0:15:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱！ 叠光破坏者！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这张卡1只怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
