Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.61,0:15:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}得手了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.11,0:15:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想得美！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.19,0:15:32.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}草{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}薙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.71,0:15:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用1个叠光单位{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
