Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.17,0:15:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力3000！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.15,0:15:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 草{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}薙{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.98,0:15:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力被逆转了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.28,0:15:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊 草{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}薙{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.84,0:15:56.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击嘎嘎嘎枪手！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.47,0:15:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想得美！速攻魔法
