Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.18,0:16:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.45,0:16:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是这个 就是这个！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.03,0:16:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这才是我追求的那种感觉啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.42,0:16:38.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈哈哈哈…！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.53,0:16:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.57,0:16:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.35,0:16:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.12,0:16:50.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.16,0:16:52.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}新的场地魔法…。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.49,0:16:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}夕阳的决斗场。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能战斗的怪兽只能各1只。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.23,0:16:59.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽被破坏的场合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.21,0:17:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.04,0:17:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}会受到300点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.24,0:17:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了…游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.91,0:17:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.81,0:17:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我用 我我我枪手攻击草{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}薙{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.09,0:17:16.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那种怪兽能干什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.83,0:17:18.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力是我这边更高！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.22,0:17:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我枪手在攻击表示的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.94,0:17:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过使用1个叠放单位
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.24,0:17:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升1000{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.47,0:17:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方的攻击力下降500点！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.66,0:17:32.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切…还挺能干的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.91,0:17:35.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 我我我枪手！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.22,0:17:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 英雄变化！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.78,0:17:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再加上 草{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}薙{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的怪兽效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.87,0:17:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将 自己发动的陷阱无效化{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.90,0:17:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}草{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}薙{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的攻击力提升500！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.64,0:18:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同归于尽吗……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.85,0:18:03.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然打倒了草{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}薙→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.49,0:18:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 还真有两下子嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.88,0:18:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你也是啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.51,0:18:15.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 这是最后的胜负了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.65,0:18:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡发动！ 超量热战！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.94,0:18:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量在战斗中被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过支付 1000生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.83,0:18:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方玩家{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.26,0:18:27.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将被破坏的怪兽超量作为素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}相同阶级的 超量怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.36,0:18:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可以特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:33.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.26,0:18:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！ 英豪冠军 断钢剑王！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.42,0:18:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 通过这个效果召唤的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.58,0:18:49.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.49,0:18:52.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗阶段结束时会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.01,0:18:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 上啊游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.33,0:18:56.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次 轮到你的回合了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:58.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.86,0:18:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.39,0:19:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不然的话 就没意思了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.66,0:19:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}彼此用王牌怪兽来决胜负吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.78,0:19:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然 特意要和 No.怪兽战斗吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.62,0:19:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好啊… 这场胜负 我接受了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.09,0:19:15.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.21,0:19:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！ No.39！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.22,0:19:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.41,0:19:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧 放马过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.23,0:19:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哦～！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.07,0:19:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用希望皇霍普攻击圣剑！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.45,0:19:35.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动圣剑的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.53,0:19:38.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗时，把超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.46,0:19:39.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全部使用的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.07,0:19:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力翻倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.22,0:19:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力4000！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.48,0:19:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动霍普的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.52,0:19:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}月之护盾！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.64,0:20:00.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}防住了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.94,0:20:01.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.72,0:20:03.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗就此结束的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.85,0:20:06.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因超量热战的效果怪兽会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.98,0:20:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后因场地魔法的效果
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.77,0:20:10.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到300点伤害{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:12.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你就输了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.25,0:20:15.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不…我还有{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.26,0:20:17.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.69,0:20:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.40,0:20:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从手牌
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.41,0:20:24.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻魔法 发动「翻倍机会」！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.22,0:20:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当怪兽的攻击被无效时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.85,0:20:31.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力变为２倍可以再攻击一次！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？攻击力５０００！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.36,0:20:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊～！霍普剑 Ｗ连斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.42,0:20:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.90,0:20:53.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最后拿下决赛名额的是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.61,0:20:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.41,0:21:02.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.72,0:21:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.88,0:21:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉啊 德罗瓦…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.44,0:21:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我输了…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.15,0:21:09.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈什！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.66,0:21:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然 你这家伙挺有感觉的嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.31,0:21:17.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真开心啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.66,0:21:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.95,0:21:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 把这个拿去吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.34,0:21:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.07,0:21:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过作为交换，要是你敢搞出
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没劲的决斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.46,0:21:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可饶不了你。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.31,0:21:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.43,0:21:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Excalibur！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.30,0:21:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 这张卡…。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.05,0:21:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所谓决斗者，就是要连败北决斗者的心意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.75,0:21:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也一并承接下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.26,0:21:41.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他把自己对决斗的心意{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.42,0:21:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托付给你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.44,0:21:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谢谢你 高修。你的心意{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.82,0:21:50.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我确实收下了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.23,0:21:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯 拜托你了 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.66,0:21:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加油啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.56,0:22:08.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 游马 快回来～！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.80,0:24:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}今天的介绍是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.88,0:24:15.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我学园的新伙伴 我我我枪手！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.54,0:24:16.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我学园？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.31,0:24:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么时候 建了那种东西？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.09,0:24:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我任命你为那个校长！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.01,0:24:22.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我是校长星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.47,0:24:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还真当啊！

